{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "biofizic-emotion-per-model",
  "title": "Finding - Emotion per model (WESAD · EEVR · CASE circumplex + timeline)",
  "tags": [
    "biofizic",
    "circumplex",
    "emotion",
    "comparison"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "title": "READ ME",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**The same emotion circumplex + timeline, computed separately for each of the 3 valence models, on YOUR live signal.** Each row = one model.\n\n- **X (valence)** = that model's `valence_personal_60s` - personally calibrated on the SERVER (neutral = your own measured resting median, per model) and 60 s-smoothed, exactly like the original WESAD circumplex. Shown only after that model's baseline locks (`valence_baseline_ready`).\n- **Y (arousal)** = the same real arousal `z_filtered` for all three (arousal is shared, only valence differs between models).\n- **Quadrant**: NW fear/anger · NE happy/excited · SW sad/bored · SE calm/relaxed. Neutral dead-band = that model's own `valence_deadband`.\n\n**WESAD** ≈ arousal-in-disguise (82%, but SHAP says it's HR) · **EEVR** ≈ chance (56%) · **CASE** ≈ real offline (58%) but COLLAPSES on the watch (domain shift - outputs a near-constant, so it sits at its own neutral). Watch how the SAME instant lands in DIFFERENT quadrants per model - that disagreement is the thesis point.\n\n**Sub fiecare model:** valenta recentrata (valence_personal_60s) + increderea, si p_positive brut (bias domain-shift). Jos: acordul intre cele 3 modele."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "WESAD",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "WESAD - circumplex (X=valence_z re-centered, Y=arousal)",
      "type": "xychart",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "biofizic-influx"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "biofizic-influx"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "queryType": "sql",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT x, y_ring, y_state FROM (SELECT 1.5*sin(g*0.0785398) AS x, 1.5*cos(g*0.0785398) AS y_ring, CAST(NULL AS DOUBLE) AS y_state FROM generate_series(0,80) AS t(g) UNION ALL SELECT GREATEST(-1.5, LEAST(1.5, v.valence_personal_60s)) AS x, CAST(NULL AS DOUBLE) AS y_ring, GREATEST(-1.5, LEAST(1.5, CAST(l.z_filtered AS DOUBLE))) AS y_state FROM biofizic_live l JOIN biofizic_legacy_valence_wesad v ON l.time = v.time WHERE l.z_filtered IS NOT NULL AND v.valence_personal_60s IS NOT NULL AND v.valence_baseline_ready >= 0.5 AND $__timeFilter(l.time)) u ORDER BY x"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "seriesMapping": "auto",
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        },
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "show": "points",
            "pointSize": {
              "fixed": 5
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "x"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "min",
                "value": -1.6
              },
              {
                "id": "max",
                "value": 1.6
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisLabel",
                "value": "VALENCE (neg ← 0 → pos)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "y_ring"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "min",
                "value": -1.6
              },
              {
                "id": "max",
                "value": 1.6
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisLabel",
                "value": "AROUSAL (calm ← 0 → activated)"
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixed": "#cccccc",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "ring"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "y_state"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixed": "#3274D9",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "WESAD"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "WESAD - emotion over time",
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "biofizic-influx"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "biofizic-influx"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "time_series",
          "queryType": "sql",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT l.time, CASE WHEN v.valence_baseline_ready < 0.5 THEN 0 WHEN abs(v.valence_personal_60s) < v.valence_deadband THEN 0 WHEN l.z_filtered >= 0 AND v.valence_personal_60s >= 0 THEN 3 WHEN l.z_filtered >= 0 THEN 4 WHEN v.valence_personal_60s >= 0 THEN 1 ELSE 2 END AS emotion FROM biofizic_live l JOIN biofizic_legacy_valence_wesad v ON l.time = v.time WHERE l.z_filtered IS NOT NULL AND v.valence_personal_60s IS NOT NULL AND $__timeFilter(l.time) ORDER BY l.time"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "neutral",
                  "color": "gray",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "calm/relaxed",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "2": {
                  "text": "sad/bored",
                  "color": "blue",
                  "index": 2
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "3": {
                  "text": "happy/excited",
                  "color": "yellow",
                  "index": 3
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "4": {
                  "text": "stress/anger",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 4
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed"
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 4
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.9
      }
    },
